    <string name="perm_limits_title">What a normal app cannot do</string>
    <string name="perm_limits_text">• MediaRecorder.AudioSource.VOICE_CALL / VOICE_DOWNLINK / VOICE_UPLINK need the system permission CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT, which is not grantable to third-party apps.\n• AudioPlaybackCapture explicitly excludes voice-call audio.\n• There is no public API to inject audio into the cellular/VoWiFi uplink.\n• TelephonyManager.isWifiCallingAvailable is hidden; VoWiFi status is reported as unknown.\nTherefore only the acoustic path (loudspeaker → far end, near-end microphone) can be tested by this software.</string>

